{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f8ee8d2f42c776d91aa45674b180c99f1a47f3e3023a1de28fca3b5b524054f4","ja":"ふふ、お客さんすっごく楽しんでくれてたわね♪\nいいライブになってよかったわ……あら？","zh":"呵呵，观众们看起来都非常尽兴呢♪\n能办成一场很棒的演出真是太好了……哎呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"583cb573a3aaaaedab337926533607ef17dc9d90b23e199557d19c20a91adfc0","ja":"このみちゃん、ゆりりん、お疲れさま～♪","zh":"小木乃美、百合百合，辛苦啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2051b832cd71e025633ee6e645369f13b0f05db4ae7a9126c17e60dcb12f334d","ja":"あれっ、海美さん！？　どうしてここに？","zh":"哎呀，海美小姐！？你怎么会在这里？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4e7c68610c297f5a80139aac3821ced98b559129ac6d16ca10ce6c0e8fa8a0b7","ja":"えへへっ♪　ふたりが今日ここで\nお仕事してるって聞いて、来てみたんだ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 听说你们两位今天在这里\n工作，我就过来看看啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2705bee9b558e71e0867e8eea98cc62e3fa3ca5b745e623dd713a5cf72c5789e","ja":"私もね、この近くで雑誌の取材があったの！","zh":"我也是在这附近接受了杂志采访呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e5436b54ab894f79cb06ac19e5150384e5fce6ec15fb28444c4929bffe85bf25","ja":"あら、そうだったの♪\nならせっかくだし、一緒にどこかに寄っていく？","zh":"哎呀，是这样啊♪\n那难得有机会，要顺便一起去哪里转转吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"737ff0b384c313579225d94d434f79e98f2c3cb1b0625e2e1b670313b1b5e762","ja":"あ、それなら私、お参りに行きたいな！\n近くに、すっごいご利益の神社があるんだって！","zh":"啊，那样的话我想去参拜呢！\n听说附近有一家特别灵验的神社哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"14fbdad29d91393887844b471107f8a32f8a540a4ad72475e3677321011ff197","ja":"『ShineLight』公演のときもお参りしたし、\n今回は武道館公演がうまくいきますようにって♪","zh":"在“ShineLight”公演时也去参拜过了，\n这次就祈求武道馆公演顺顺利利吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"714dee5feaf059583fd234c02eb37c2f8449ffe7ebbaff26e1228cb3a6764193","ja":"わぁっ、いいですね♪\nこの間の公演も大成功でしたし！","zh":"哇，真不错呢♪\n上次的演出也很成功！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d5cf081ad249f7a9af7a7ae2df58cbb8591c740cb2c8582844105626d620c150","ja":"近くにあるのも何かの縁だし、行ってみましょうか。\nじゃあ、着替えてくるからちょっと待っててね♪","zh":"既然就在附近也是种缘分，不如去看看吧。\n那我先去换身衣服，稍微等我一下哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"264b72060e9934500ce71438d86d91db12d7ad8ea20740775e91125e8bad6032","ja":"うん！\nそのあと、準備運動もちゃんとしようね！","zh":"嗯！\n在那之后，也要好好做准备运动哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1119.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6139514ed4afd0ae198bc3fc101a47d351c7c4c352f50aea2cc6eee550710657","ja":"はい！\n……えっ？　お参りに行くのに、準備運動……？","zh":"好！\n……咦？去参拜还要做准备运动……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
